        <AlertDescription>
          <p>Unlike multi-node clusters, by default all ingress traffic is routed to the single control-plane node, even after adding additional worker nodes.</p>
        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      <p>There are several ways that you can add worker nodes to a single-node cluster. You can add worker nodes to a cluster manually, using <a href="https://console.redhat.com/openshift/assisted-installer/clusters">{"{"}{"{"} cluster_manager_first {"}"}{"}"}</a>, or by using the Assisted Installer REST API directly.</p>
